| Dimension                   | Recommended Approach — ELT                                    |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Where transform happens     | Inside BigQuery after loading raw CSVs                        |
| Raw data preserved?         | Yes — store raw batch files in cloud storage/BigQuery staging |
| Latency profile             | Batch / daily processing                                      |
| Transformation rigidity     | Flexible SQL/dbt transformations                              |
| Compute location            | Cloud-native BigQuery compute                                 |
| Data ingestion style        | Batch ELT pipeline                                            |
| Handling schema differences | Normalize after loading                                       |
| Sensitive data handling     | Anonymize/mask before analytics layer                         |
| Cost driver                 | Cheap storage + on-demand analytics compute                   |
| Main benefit                | Faster adaptation to changing reporting needs                 |
| Main risk if skipped        | Constant pipeline rewrites and data inconsistencies           |
